<title>PORTUGAL: Unicer '96 cons with min. interests down.</title>
<headline>Unicer '96 cons with min. interests down.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jan 1 to Dec 31:</p>
<p>(billion escudos, unless stated)</p>
<p>Cons net with minority interests 2.383 vs 3.059</p>
<p>Operating result 3.94 vs 5.939</p>
<p>Financial result 0.540 loss vs 0.617 loss</p>
<p>Curent result 3.4 vs 5.322</p>
<p>Dividend 105 esc vs 105 esc</p>
<p>Turnover 45.731 vs 44.211</p>
<p>Note - Unicer-Uniao Cervejeira is a Portuguese drinks company.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom 351-1-3538254</p>
